           iissccssiiccttll --AA --tt _i_q_n_._2_0_1_2_-_0_6_._c_o_m_._e_x_a_m_p_l_e_:_t_a_r_g_e_t_0 --pp _1_9_2_._1_6_8_._1_._1

     Perform discovery on 192.168.1.1, and add disabled sessions for each dis‐
     covered target; use --MM --ee oonn to connect them:
           iissccssiiccttll --AA --dd _1_9_2_._1_6_8_._1_._1 --ee _o_f_f

     Disconnect all iSCSI sessions:
           iissccssiiccttll --RRaa

